  "body": "Set on a freehold title and offering approximately 142.3m² of thoughtfully designed living space, this brand-new standalone residence delivers the perfect balance of comfort, style, and functionality.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Approx. 142.3m² floor area on a freehold title\r\n• 3 generous double bedrooms, study, including a master ensuite with walk-in wardrobe\r\n• 2.5 fully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n• Designer kitchen with granite benchtops and quality appliances\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n• Private outdoor courtyard, perfect for entertaining or relaxing\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n• Quality finishes throughout with low-maintenance landscaping\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Highland Park Shopping Centre, Half Moon Bay Marina, and Botany Town Centre, providing easy access to shopping, cafés, restaurants, and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones:\r\nZoned for:\r\n• Macleans Primary School\r\n• Howick Intermediate\r\n• Pakuranga College\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, investing, or searching for your family home with excellent school zone, where is a great chance for you. Our motivated vendors will meet the market. Call us to view!",
